issue_context.body:
Expect to be able to generate RSA keys with bitlen >2048 and <3072 as it is FIPS valid. 

Observation during RSA key gen using old API (EVP_PKEY_CTX_set_rsa_keygen_bits) but with fips provider loaded into NULL context. 

- As expected, setting bits = 2048, 3072 or 4096 succeed no problem.
- Setting bits > 3072 succeeds also.
- But setting bits > 2048 and less than 3072 returns error (with no error info)

```
#include <openssl/provider.h>
#include <openssl/crypto.h>
#include <openssl/evp.h>
#include <openssl/err.h>
#include <openssl/rsa.h>


int main(int argc, char *argv[]) 
{
    EVP_PKEY *pkey = NULL;
    EVP_PKEY_CTX *gen_ctx;
    int ret;
    int bits = 2080; /* example failing bits value */

    OSSL_PROVIDER_set_default_search_path(NULL, "/home/user/ossl-install/main/lib/ossl-modules/");
    if (!OPENSSL_CTX_load_config(NULL, "/home/user/ossl-install/cnf/openssl.cnf")) goto end;

    ret = OSSL_PROVIDER_available(NULL, "default");
    printf("default provider available: %d\n", ret);
    ret = OSSL_PROVIDER_available(NULL, "fips");
    printf("fips provider available: %d\n", ret);

    printf("Generating RSA key ( %d bits) \n", bits);
    gen_ctx = EVP_PKEY_CTX_new_id(NID_rsaEncryption, NULL);   
    if (gen_ctx == NULL) goto end;

    if (EVP_PKEY_keygen_init(gen_ctx) <= 0) goto end;

    if (EVP_PKEY_CTX_set_rsa_keygen_bits(gen_ctx, bits) <= 0) goto end;

    if (EVP_PKEY_keygen(gen_ctx, &pkey) <= 0) goto end;
    
    printf("... done generating RSA key\n");

end:
    printf ("err:\n");
    ERR_print_errors_fp(stderr);
    EVP_PKEY_free(pkey);
    EVP_PKEY_CTX_free(gen_ctx);
    return 1;
}
```
And the openssl.cnf contains

```
openssl_conf = openssl_init

.include /home/user/ossl-install/cnf/fips.cnf
[openssl_init]
providers = provider_sect
alg_section = algorithm_sect

[provider_sect]
fips = fips_sect

[algorithm_sect]
default_properties = fips=yes
```
And failing output

```
default provider available: 0
fips provider available: 1
Generating RSA key ( 2080 bits) 
err:
```

